    owl:distinctMembers ( vsr:ReadinessNotStarted vsr:ReadinessInProgress vsr:ReadinessAtRisk vsr:ReadinessBlocked vsr:ReadyWithConditions vsr:Ready vsr:ReadinessExpired vsr:ReadinessSuspended vsr:ReadinessNotApplicable ) .

